index a096fdeaa7887dacb1a4d37aa15f76c4236763e6..5e0ce030b8a38b2c9782dcee024fb4f32bbc9d21 100644
--- a/docs/cli.rst
+++ b/docs/cli.rst
@@ -712,6 +712,15 @@ You can delete all the existing rows in the table before inserting the new recor
 
     $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs dogs.json --truncate
 
+You can extract repeated values into lookup tables using ``--extract``. The option
+can be repeated to extract more than one column::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils insert trees.db trees trees.json \
+        --extract species --extract family
+
+Each extracted column is replaced by an integer foreign key to a lookup table with
+the same name as that column. Duplicate values share the same lookup-table row.
+
 .. _cli_inserting_data_binary:
 
 Inserting binary data
